    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201402011/2014020110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうしたんだ、急に",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014020110050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ひとりで完璧にやるぞ～！\r\nって思ってたのに、こうなっちゃったから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201402011/2014020110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やりきったあとのちょっとしたケガだ\r\n勲章だと考えればいいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、増えれば増えるほど\r\n次への自信につながっていくだろ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014020110060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……えへへ\r\nいい考え方だね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201402011/2014020110060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
